<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Richmond Cty, Ga., Board of Ed.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Richmond Cty, Ga., Board of Ed.</headline>
<text>
<p>COUNTY BOARD OF EDUCATION OF RICHMOND COUNTY</p>
<p>GEORGIA GENERAL OBLIGATION SCHOOL BONDS, SERIES 97</p>
<p>REGISTERED</p>
<p>RE: $115,000,000</p>
<p>RECEIVED THE WRITTEN</p>
<p>AWARD.</p>
<p>EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, ALL BONDS ARE FREE TO TRADE.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>	   A1 UNDERLYING	    A UNDERLYING</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 01/01/1997</p>
