<p>CALL FEATURES: The bonds are redeemable at the option of the District, in whole or in part by lot in inverse order of maturity on any interest payment date beginning 5/1/98 at par plus accrued interest. The District presently plans to call a referendum on 3/18/97 on the imposition of a 1% special purpose local option sales tax to provide funds for the purpose of, among other things,redeeming the Bonds.</p>
